sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent in isolated target
    participant G as MCP gateway
    participant S as Session policy
    participant P as Approval store
    participant D as Domain service
    participant U as Audit store

    A->>G: Tool call plus session identity
    G->>S: Resolve session and require tool
    S-->>G: Allowed, denied, or approval required
    alt denied
        G->>U: Record denied attempt
        G-->>A: Structured policy error
    else approval required
        G->>P: Match exact active approval grant
        P-->>G: Grant or missing/expired/mismatched
        G->>U: Record decision
    end
    G->>D: Execute validated request
    D-->>G: Result or domain error
    G->>U: Record outcome and sanitized arguments
    G-->>A: Tool result
